    "raw": "Callix, you not believe me when I write you in new language over ansible! There are thinking light-people! For real! Not like legends, but actual light-people. They always talking in strange accents, and is making dark places not dark. Perhaps is magick? Nice enough, but not try to touch or lick. Warm. Also not like licks, apparently. You come meet me in Protectorate worlds, and I show you light-men. Together we attempt to catch one and make friend!",
    "value": "卡利克斯！用新话写信你还不信！真有会发光的活人！不唬你！不是老辈传的那种，是真光人儿！说话怪腔怪调，黑地儿让他们一照就亮堂。怕是魔法？人倒不赖，就是别上手摸也别舔。热乎的，而且不乐意被舔。你来守护团地盘找我，带你逮个光人交朋友！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "But we has care to take, because people in new space empire seem not to like when you catch and play with other living things. Also, especially not like when using claws and teeth to play. But even so, come meet. Light-people make life more interesting.",
    "value": "可得留神，新太空帝国那帮家伙不兴抓活物玩儿。更别提用牙爪耍闹了。不过管他呢，快来！光人让日子得劲多了！"
